summary.description:
The blurb, as a metadata source wrote it. Never edited by the app;
what *you* think goes in `notes`, and keeping the two apart is what
lets a re-fetch replace one without touching the other.

dayOfMonth.description:
Only on this day of the month, `1..=28`, as well as on `days`.
`None` is every day `days` allows. Added for the monthly dream;
capped at 28 so that every month has the day.

